  "fullSource": "use IO.Std.write_line\n\nclass Animal abstract is si\n\nclass Cat(name: string): Animal is\n    purr() -> string => \"{name} purrs\"\nsi\n\nclass Dog(name: string): Animal is\n    bark() -> string => \"{name} barks\"\nsi\n\nlet a: Animal = Dog(\"rover\")\nif let c: Cat = a then\n    write_line(c.purr())\nelif let d: Dog = a then\n    write_line(d.bark())\nelse\n    write_line(\"some other animal\")\nfi\n",
